Yes, I believe that error occurs due to a bug in runjags, and I notified the author of runjags (I suspect that something changed in the newest version of R to lead to the error). The error occurs when the model is slow to converge and the psrf values are relatively large. I have set blavaan's convergence default to "manual" until the bug is fixed.

Ed

